        "slc_1b32d949306b29f9d4c08deaec1dbf6160009b6a3a23ae7ac3435c9520d356b0"
      ],
      "text": "T3 Code lets users control coding agents remotely through an iOS app, Android app, web app, and an Electron-based desktop app."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a90ec8c4f5a55439ecb62a29a8960a915bda536db9df6524c074f5abfb3c5a11",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "66e39ca2aabde054bc50312a9c34f05dbd1f6f9e",
          "git_sha": "27b5dc491693608b79b6e39f37a72b1007d467fd",
          "line_end": 5,
          "line_start": 5,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "pingdotgg/t3code",
          "url": "https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code/blob/66e39ca2aabde054bc50312a9c34f05dbd1f6f9e/README.md#L5-L5"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_26f8fead6e0b483ce441c35d03abe9d12df93885f6107a6f44ab94d110f41d07"
      ],
      "text": "The product works with existing subscriptions to Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Grok Build, OpenCode, and Google Antigravity, controlling those agents when set up on the user's computer."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c506279bb5c893287914e4cd0173e9cb6bf7032827dc32809f4e5d070cb634ad",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "66e39ca2aabde054bc50312a9c34f05dbd1f6f9e",
          "git_sha": "27b5dc491693608b79b6e39f37a72b1007d467fd",
          "line_end": 23,
          "line_start": 15,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "pingdotgg/t3code",
          "url": "https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code/blob/66e39ca2aabde054bc50312a9c34f05dbd1f6f9e/README.md#L15-L23"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_41bfd111043c715263b2adb9d9fe94d618fc7bedd9f88c7197eace1c3ff40ff6"
      ],
      "text": "At least one provider must be installed and authenticated before use; each provider names a CLI and login command, while Antigravity is enabled in Settings with Google sign-in and needs no CLI."
    },
    {
