        "slc_e8b465a9c903096fd5e5b02062f9aba85006e634109066102b2b2e3ff6e320bc"
      ],
      "text": "Running `npx t3@latest` launches the T3 Code backend on the local machine plus a local web app for controlling agents; a `--help` flag exposes the full CLI reference."
    },
    {
